  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Parking for 8 Vehicles + Ample Golf Cart Parking<br>- Natural Gas Grill<br>- Pet Friendly (Additional Fee Applies)<br>- Private Pool (Complimentary Pool Heating Available October 1-May 1)<br>- Pool House<br>- Child Proof Windows Throughout the Property<br>- Outside Balcony with Gulf Views<br>- Adjacent to The Red Bar<br>- Steps to Sugar White Sands of Grayton Beach<br><br>DETAILS:<br>A stunning 6 bedroom home nestled in the heart of Grayton Beach awaits you. Just steps away from the beach and the world-renowned Red Bar, this charming and unique property can comfortably accommodate up to 18 guests (and pet-friendly too!) Prepare to be enchanted by the hand-painted folk art and the unmistakable vibe that permeates every corner of this exceptional residence.<br><br>As you ascend to the second floor, you will be greeted by intricately hand-painted doors and captivating custom art that adorn each step. The expansive dining area, boasting two tables and a bar area, can easily seat up to 20 people. Just imagine the delightful meals and lively games that can be shared in this inviting space. The kitchen, exuding a funky charm, is equipped with top-of-the-line stainless steel appliances (plus, a seafood boiler kit for a fun family cookout). The living area, complete with plush couches and chairs, features a flat-screen television and offers a breathtaking view of the beach through the patio doors. Additionally, the second floor is home to a luxurious master bedroom with a king-size bed and a private bathroom featuring a walk-in shower. For the convenience of all guests, there is also a half bath on this floor.<br><br>Venture up to the third floor and be captivated by the myriad of paintings that adorn the walls. This floor boasts four bedrooms, including two king bedrooms, one queen bedroom, and a playful bunk room adorned with graffiti art that will surely delight everyone. The third floor is completed with a wet bar, a laundry area, and an additional twin trundle bed. Step out onto the balcony, where swings and ample seating invite you to relax and soak in the breathtaking views.<br><br>But that s not all! Indulge in the luxury of your own private pool, conveniently located just outside the back door. With plenty of seating available, everyone can bask in the sun and enjoy a refreshing swim. Adjacent to the pool house, you will find an exterior half bath for easy access. The pool house itself offers a fully equipped kitchen, a laundry area, a full bath with a walk-in shower, a trundle bed, and a king murphy bed, providing additional sleeping options for your convenience.<br><br>Come and experience all that Grayton Beach has to offer at this exceptional property located at 255 Garfield Street. Here, luxury and a laid-back atmosphere seamlessly blend together, creating the perfect backdrop for an unforgettable vacation.<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>- Laundry Room<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>- Kitchen<br>- Living Room<br>- Dinning Area<br>- Master Bedroom: King Bed (2), Private Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>- Half Bath<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed (2), Private Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed (2), Shared Hall Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>- Guest Bedroom: Two Twin Over Twin Bunk Beds (4), Shared Hall Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed (2), Shared Hall Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Wet Bar/ Closet Laundry Area/ Built In Twin Trundle Bed (2)<br><br>POOL HOUSE:<br>- King Murphy Bed (2)<br>- Twin Trundle Bed (2)<br>- Laundry Area<br>- Kitchen<br>- Private Bathroom with Walk In Shower<br>- Exterior Half Bath for Pool Use",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Limited Time March Savings | Pet-Friendly, Private Pool, Steps to Beach Access & Red Bar!"
        }
      ],
